#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"DLAA = clean edges at the game's render size. DLSS = the same, and it upscales when the game's "
"Scaling is below 100 %. off = the game's own picture: use it to compare. Saved at once."
msgstr ""
"DLAA = čisti robovi v velikosti izrisa igre. DLSS = isto, poleg tega povečuje, ko je Prilagajanje "
"igre pod 100 %. izk. = izvorna slika igre: za primerjavo. Shrani se takoj."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Presets for your GPU. high = everything on (model 1). medium = model 2, half-size see-through "
"depth, flat mirrors without part motion, lighter part-motion search. low = also no mirror DLAA, "
"no see-through depth, VR area 60 %. Never changes a setting you set yourself."
msgstr ""
"Prednastavitve za vašo grafično kartico. visoka = vse vklopljeno (model 1). srednja = model 2, "
"polovična globina prosojnosti, ravna ogledala brez gibanja delov, lažje iskanje gibanja delov. "
"nizka = tudi brez DLAA ogledal, brez globine prosojnosti, območje VR 60 %. Nikoli ne spremeni "
"tistega, kar ste nastavili sami."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"1 (K) = most detail, sharpest text, about 1.6x the GPU of 2. 2 (E) = balanced, least ghosting "
"behind traffic: start here. 3 (F) = calmest on fences and wires, can smear moving detail, same "
"cost as 2. 4 (M) = heaviest (about 5x), flat tests only."
msgstr ""
"1 (K) = največ podrobnosti, najostrejše besedilo, približno 1,6x GPU modela 2. 2 (E) = "
"uravnotežen, najmanj duhov za prometom: začnite tu. 3 (F) = najmirnejši na ograjah in žicah, "
"lahko zamegli premikajoče se podrobnosti, enaka cena kot 2. 4 (M) = najtežji (približno 5x), samo "
"za teste v ravnem načinu."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Picture quality: sharpening, texture sharpness, the DLAA area and the see-through depth. Right "
"opens the group, Left closes it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Kakovost slike: ostrenje, ostrina tekstur, območje DLAA in globina prosojnosti. Desno skupino "
"odpre, Levo jo zapre; ob vsakem odprtju menija je zaprta."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Sharpens the picture after DLAA, 0 (off) to 1.0. Raise it if the picture looks soft; too high "
"gives bright halos on edges. Costs about 0.1 ms; 0 skips the pass."
msgstr ""
"Izostri sliko po DLAA, od 0 (izk.) do 1,0. Povečajte, če je slika mehka; preveč daje svetle "
"sijaje na robovih. Stane približno 0,1 ms; 0 preskoči ta prehod."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How far the sharpening reaches, 1 to 4 px: small = fine detail, large = bolder edges. Change it "
"if the sharpening looks too fine or too coarse; a picture drawn larger than the screen, as in VR, "
"needs more than 1 px."
msgstr ""
"Kako daleč seže ostrenje, 1 do 4 px: majhno = fine podrobnosti, veliko = krepkejši robovi. "
"Spremenite, če je ostrenje preveč fino ali grobo; slika, večja od zaslona, kot v VR, potrebuje "
"več kot 1 px."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Sharper texture text (road signs, dashboard, GPS). 0 = off; more negative = sharper but more "
"shimmer on fences; try -0.5 to -1 if text is blurry. No GPU time, only a little memory bandwidth."
msgstr ""
"Ostrejše besedilo v teksturah (prometni znaki, armaturna plošča, GPS). 0 = izk.; bolj negativno = "
"ostreje, a več utripanja na ograjah; poskusite -0,5 do -1, če je besedilo zamegljeno. Brez "
"obremenitve GPU, le malo pasovne širine pomnilnika."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The same for wire fences, grass and leaf cut-outs: raise it toward 0 if fences shimmer, lower it "
"if grass looks soft. same = follows the row above. Acts only while Texture sharpness is not 0. No "
"GPU time, a little memory."
msgstr ""
"Isto za žičnate ograje, travo in listje: povečajte proti 0, če ograje utripajo, zmanjšajte, če je "
"trava mehka. enako = sledi vrstici zgoraj. Deluje le, če Ostrina tekstur ni 0. Brez obremenitve "
"GPU, nekaj pomnilnika."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR: only the middle of each eye gets DLAA (20 to 100 %); the edge keeps the game's picture. Lower "
"it to afford a heavier model or win frame rate; 40 % costs about 40 % of the model. Also sets the "
"garage / main-menu truck."
msgstr ""
"VR: DLAA dobi samo sredina vsakega očesa (20 do 100 %); rob obdrži sliko igre. Zmanjšajte za "
"težji model ali več sličic; 40 % stane približno 40 % modela. Nastavi tudi tovornjak v garaži / "
"glavnem meniju."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Flat only: DLAA before the game's bloom / tonemap, so lane paint, wires and rails shimmer less. "
"Change it only to compare. Not used with DLSS upscale or Windows HDR. Same cost either way; takes "
"~60 frames to switch."
msgstr ""
"Samo ravni način: DLAA pred bloomom / tonemappingom igre, zato črte na cesti, žice in tirnice "
"utripajo manj. Spreminjajte le za primerjavo. Ne velja z DLSS povečevanjem ali Windows HDR. Enaka "
"cena; preklop traja približno 60 sličic."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Gives wires, fences and glass their own distance instead of what is behind them, so they do not "
"smear when you move. Turn it off if you see no smearing there: saves 0.02 - 0.06 ms per eye."
msgstr ""
"Žicam, ograjam in steklu da lastno razdaljo namesto tiste od ozadja, zato se ob premikanju ne "
"mažejo. Izklopite, če tam ne vidite razmazanosti: prihrani 0,02 - 0,06 ms na oko."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Stops street-lamp and car-light glows leaving a trail behind them when you move: DLSS takes each "
"glow from the current frame, not its history. 25 % steps; lower it if lamp glows flicker, 0 = "
"off. Costs about 0.05 - 0.2 ms per eye."
msgstr ""
"Prepreči, da bi sijaj uličnih svetilk in avtomobilskih luči pri premikanju vlekel sled: DLSS "
"vzame vsak sijaj iz trenutne sličice, ne iz zgodovine. Koraki po 25 %; zmanjšajte, če sijaji "
"utripajo, 0 = izk. Stane približno 0,05 - 0,2 ms na oko."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How moving parts and truck mirrors are handled by DLAA. Right opens the group, Left closes it; it "
"starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Kako DLAA obravnava premične dele in ogledala tovornjaka. Desno skupino odpre, Levo jo zapre; ob "
"vsakem odprtju menija je zaprta."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Gives each moving part (traffic, wheels, plates) its own motion for DLAA, so it stays sharp and "
"does not ghost. Turn it off only to save about 0.5 ms per eye or to test: every pixel then moves "
"with the camera and traffic smears."
msgstr ""
"Vsakemu premičnemu delu (promet, kolesa, tablice) da lastno gibanje za DLAA, zato ostane oster in "
"ne vleče duhov. Izklopite le za prihranek približno 0,5 ms na oko ali za test: potem se vsak "
"piksel premika s kamero in promet se maže."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Gives truck mirrors their own DLAA so they do not shimmer. 1 mirror = only the largest (the main "
"mirror next to you). all = every mirror. camera = cheapest per mirror, moving traffic can ghost "
"in the glass; else each part moves exactly in the glass."
msgstr ""
"Ogledalom tovornjaka da lasten DLAA, da ne utripajo. 1 ogledalo = le največje (glavno ob vas). "
"vsa = vsako ogledalo. kamera = najcenejše na ogledalo, premikajoč se promet lahko v steklu vleče "
"duhove; sicer se vsak del premika natančno v steklu."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"on = each mirror gets its DLAA every 2nd frame and shows its last clean picture in between: about "
"half the mirror cost. Edges stay clean; moving things in the glass update at half rate. off = "
"every mirror every frame."
msgstr ""
"vkl. = vsako ogledalo dobi DLAA vsako 2. sličico in vmes pokaže zadnjo čisto sliko: približno "
"polovica cene ogledal. Robovi ostanejo čisti; premikajoče se stvari v steklu se osvežujejo s "
"polovično hitrostjo. izk. = vsako ogledalo vsako sličico."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Thin wires keep their motion while you drive: DLAA spreads the motion data over thin lines (DLSS "
"motion dilation). on = default. off = only to compare; near wires flicker more. The picture is "
"soft for a moment when it changes."
msgstr ""
"Tanke žice med vožnjo obdržijo gibanje: DLAA razširi podatke gibanja na tanke črte (dilatacija "
"gibanja DLSS). vkl. = privzeto. izk. = samo za primerjavo; bližnje žice bolj utripajo. Ob "
"spremembi je slika za trenutek mehka."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Thin wires get depth on every pixel they touch, not only where they cover a pixel centre. on = "
"default. on (no A2C) = also for see-through edges. off = only to compare; near wires flicker more."
msgstr ""
"Tanke žice dobijo globino na vsakem pikslu, ki se ga dotaknejo, ne le tam, kjer prekrivajo "
"središče piksla. vkl. = privzeto. vkl. (brez A2C) = tudi za prosojne robove. izk. = samo za "
"primerjavo; bližnje žice bolj utripajo."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Experimental: draws far wires that are thinner than 1 pixel as a 1 pixel line, so they do not "
"break into dashes. Off by default: far wires may look darker or flicker more. Try it and compare."
msgstr ""
"Poskusno: oddaljene žice, tanjše od 1 piksla, nariše kot črto širine 1 piksla, da se ne trgajo v "
"črtice. Privzeto izk.: oddaljene žice lahko izgledajo temnejše ali bolj utripajo. Poskusite in "
"primerjajte."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"DLSS upscale, the DLAA on / off switch and the OFXR Bridge / VectorXR info. Right opens the "
"group, Left closes it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Povečevanje DLSS, stikalo DLAA vkl. / izk. in informacije o OFXR Bridge / VectorXR. Desno skupino "
"odpre, Levo jo zapre; ob vsakem odprtju menija je zaprta."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"DLSS draws the picture back up to full size when the game's Scaling is below 100 %: sharper than "
"the game's own stretch, and fewer pixels drawn means more fps. No extra cost; does nothing at "
"Scaling 100 %."
msgstr ""
"DLSS nariše sliko nazaj v polni velikosti, ko je Prilagajanje igre pod 100 %: ostreje kot lastno "
"raztegovanje igre, manj pikslov pa pomeni več fps. Brez dodatne cene; pri Prilagajanju 100 % ne "
"naredi nič."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Switches the whole mod on or off and keeps the mode; off shows the game's own picture, for "
"comparing. Off saves the cost of every part together."
msgstr ""
"Vklopi ali izklopi celoten mod in si zapomni način; izk. pokaže sliko same igre, za primerjavo. "
"Izk. prihrani ceno vseh delov skupaj."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"OFXR Bridge = VR frame generation by djules75, a separate download "
"(github.com/djules75/OFXR-Bridge). found = its layer is loaded in this game and the mod lets its "
"work pass through. Start its tray app before the game."
msgstr ""
"OFXR Bridge = generiranje sličic za VR od djules75, ločen prenos "
"(github.com/djules75/OFXR-Bridge). najden = njegov sloj je naložen v tej igri in mod spusti "
"njegovo delo skozi. Zaženite njegovo aplikacijo v sistemski vrstici pred igro."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VectorXR = an OpenXR enhancement suite by DienerTech (github.com/DienerTech/vectorxr): Turbo, "
"Depth, frame generation; found = its layer is loaded in the game and the mod lets its work pass "
"through. Run only one Turbo (its or the mod's)."
msgstr ""
"VectorXR = nabor izboljšav OpenXR od DienerTech (github.com/DienerTech/vectorxr): Turbo, globina, "
"generiranje sličic; najden = njegov sloj je naložen v igri in mod spusti njegovo delo skozi. "
"Uporabljajte le en Turbo (njegov ali modov)."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR speed-ups: Turbo, foveated rendering and the hidden area mask. Right opens the group, Left "
"closes it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Pospešitve VR: Turbo, foveated rendering in maska skritega območja. Desno skupino odpre, Levo jo "
"zapre; ob vsakem odprtju menija je zaprta."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Turbo: no ASW / Motion Smoothing / SSW / reprojection. VR only. On = the game stops waiting for "
"the headset each frame: more fps only when the CPU is the limit (busy cities, traffic). Turn it "
"off if the picture judders. From OpenXR Toolkit."
msgstr ""
"Turbo: brez ASW / Motion Smoothing / SSW / reprojekcije. Samo VR. vkl. = igra ne čaka na slušalke "
"vsako sličico: več fps le, ko omejuje CPU (zasedena mesta, promet). Izklopite, če slika zatika. "
"Iz OpenXR Toolkit."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Sharp centre, lower detail at the edge (NVIDIA RTX only). Saves GPU time at high Scaling. VR "
"only. The outer ring is shaded once per 2 x 2 pixels; fences, grass and leaves keep full detail. "
"Turn it off if the edge looks blocky."
msgstr ""
"Oster center, manj podrobnosti na robu (samo NVIDIA RTX). Prihrani GPU pri visokem Prilagajanju. "
"Samo VR. Zunanji obroč se senči enkrat na 2 x 2 piksla; ograje, trava in listje obdržijo polno "
"podrobnost. Izklopite, če rob izgleda kockasto."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How big the sharp centre of Foveated (VRS) is, 10 - 100 % in 5 % steps: bigger = more of the view "
"sharp, less saving; smaller = more saving, lower detail starts closer to the middle. 80 % "
"(balanced) is the default; 90 = wide, 65 = narrow."
msgstr ""
"Kako velik je oster center Foveated (VRS), 10 - 100 % v korakih po 5 %: večji = več ostrega "
"pogleda, manj prihranka; manjši = več prihranka, nižja podrobnost se začne bliže sredini. 80 % "
"(uravnotežen) je privzeto; 90 = širok, 65 = ozek."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Which of the game's passes Foveated (VRS) acts on. scene = the 3D world only (default). scene + "
"lighting = also the game's lighting pass, at the very edge only: more saving. Test it: look for "
"blocky light or shadow edges at the side of your view."
msgstr ""
"Na katere prehode igre deluje Foveated (VRS). prizor = samo 3D svet (privzeto). prizor + "
"osvetlitev = tudi prehod osvetlitve igre, samo na skrajnem robu: več prihranka. Preizkusite: "
"iščite kockaste robove luči ali senc ob strani pogleda."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How coarse the outer ring of Foveated (VRS) is. Normal = 1 colour per 2 x 2 pixels (default). "
"Strong = per 4 x 2, Max = per 4 x 4: more GPU saving, blockier edges. Best with eye tracking, "
"where you never look at the outer ring."
msgstr ""
"Kako grob je zunanji obroč Foveated (VRS). Običajen = 1 barva na 2 x 2 piksla (privzeto). Močan = "
"na 4 x 2, Maks. = na 4 x 4: več prihranka GPU, bolj kockasti robovi. Najbolje s sledenjem očem, "
"kjer na zunanji obroč nikoli ne gledate."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Experimental. The sharp centre of Foveated (VRS) follows your eyes on a headset with eye tracking "
"(OpenXR eye gaze, for example Varjo); without one it stays at the lens centre. Needs Foveated "
"(VRS) on at the game's start, else a restart. Almost no cost."
msgstr ""
"Poskusno. Oster center Foveated (VRS) sledi vašim očem na slušalkah s sledenjem očem (pogled "
"OpenXR, na primer Varjo); brez njega ostane v središču leče. Zahteva vklopljen Foveated (VRS) ob "
"zagonu igre, sicer ponovni zagon. Skoraj brez cene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only. The game skips the lens corners you never see (the headset reports them), so it draws "
"fewer pixels: more GPU headroom, the picture you see stays the same. The first switch-on needs a "
"game restart. Turn it off if the edge of the view looks wrong."
msgstr ""
"Samo VR. Igra preskoči vogale leč, ki jih nikoli ne vidite (slušalke jih sporočijo), zato nariše "
"manj pikslov: več rezerve GPU, vidna slika ostane enaka. Prvi vklop zahteva ponovni zagon igre. "
"Izklopite, če rob pogleda izgleda narobe."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Frame rate limits and CPU: NVIDIA Reflex and an FPS cap for flat, a VR FPS cap, CPU tuning. Right "
"opens the group, Left closes it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Omejitve sličic in CPU: NVIDIA Reflex in omejitev FPS za ravni način, omejitev FPS za VR, "
"nastavitev CPU. Desno skupino odpre, Levo jo zapre; ob vsakem odprtju menija je zaprta."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Flat only, NVIDIA only. On = the game's frames wait less in the GPU queue: less input lag when "
"the GPU is the limit. Boost also keeps the GPU clocks up. Same fps; small cost. Not used in VR."
msgstr ""
"Samo ravni način, samo NVIDIA. vkl. = sličice igre čakajo v čakalni vrsti GPU manj: manjši zamik "
"vnosa, ko omejuje GPU. Boost dodatno drži visoke takte GPU. Enaki fps; majhna cena. V VR se ne "
"uporablja."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Flat only. Holds the game at most at this frame rate: a steady frame time, less heat and power. "
"Set it a bit below what your PC holds in a busy city. With Reflex on, the NVIDIA driver does the "
"limiting. off = no limit."
msgstr ""
"Samo ravni način. Drži igro največ na tej hitrosti sličic: stalen čas sličice, manj toplote in "
"energije. Nastavite malo pod tisto, kar vaš računalnik drži v zasedenem mestu. Z vklopljenim "
"Reflex omejuje gonilnik NVIDIA. izk. = brez omejitve."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only. half = the game draws every 2nd headset frame (72 Hz -> 36 fps), third = every 3rd; the "
"headset's reprojection (ASW / Motion Smoothing) fills the rest at a steady rhythm. Use it when "
"the fps swings. Turns Turbo off while on."
msgstr ""
"Samo VR. polovica = igra nariše vsako 2. sličico slušalk (72 Hz -> 36 fps), tretjina = vsako 3.; "
"reprojekcija slušalk (ASW / Motion Smoothing) napolni ostalo v enakomernem ritmu. Uporabite, ko "
"fps nihajo. Medtem ko je vklopljeno, izklopi Turbo."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Three CPU switches together: the main and render thread prefer the P-cores (Intel hybrid CPUs "
"only), the game runs at Above normal priority, and Windows may not throttle it (EcoQoS) or ignore "
"its timer requests. Helps when the CPU is the limit; no cost. Separate settings in dlaa.ini: "
"cpu_pcore, cpu_priority, cpu_no_throttle."
msgstr ""
"Tri stikala CPU skupaj: glavna in renderirna nit raje uporabljata jedra P (samo hibridni Intelovi "
"CPU), igra teče s prioriteto Nad običajno, Windows pa je ne sme dušiti (EcoQoS) ali prezreti "
"njenih zahtev za časovnik. Pomaga, ko omejuje CPU; brez cene. Ločene nastavitve v dlaa.ini: "
"cpu_pcore, cpu_priority, cpu_no_throttle."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The panel's position, size, depth, facing and the menu keys. Right opens the group, Left closes "
"it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Položaj, velikost, globina in obrat plošče ter tipke menija. Desno skupino odpre, Levo jo zapre; "
"ob vsakem odprtju menija je zaprta."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only. Follow head = the panel moves with the headset. Fixed in cab = it stays at one spot in "
"front of your seat, steady while you look around; X / Y / depth then set that spot (degrees, "
"metres). Needs the VR layer (default). No cost."
msgstr ""
"Samo VR. Sledi glavi = plošča se premika s slušalkami. Fiksno v kabini = ostane na enem mestu "
"pred sedežem, stabilno ob razgledovanju; X / Y / globina nato nastavijo to mesto (stopinje, "
"metri). Zahteva sloj VR (privzeto). Brez cene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves this panel sideways, in % of the screen (VR fixed in cab: degrees around your seat). Flat "
"and VR each keep their own position. Use it if the panel covers something you need. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Premakne ploščo vstran, v % zaslona (VR fiksno v kabini: stopinje okoli sedeža). Ravni način in "
"VR imata vsak svoj položaj. Uporabite, če plošča zakriva kaj, kar potrebujete. Brez cene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves this panel up / down, in % of the screen (VR fixed in cab: degrees, plus = down). Flat and "
"VR each keep their own position. Use it if the panel covers something you need. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Premakne ploščo gor / dol, v % zaslona (VR fiksno v kabini: stopinje, plus = dol). Ravni način in "
"VR imata vsak svoj položaj. Uporabite, če plošča zakriva kaj, kar potrebujete. Brez cene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Makes this panel bigger or smaller. Raise it if you cannot read it, lower it if it covers too "
"much. Flat and VR each keep their own size. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Ploščo poveča ali zmanjša. Povečajte, če je ne morete prebrati, zmanjšajte, če zakriva preveč. "
"Ravni način in VR imata vsak svojo velikost. Brez cene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. How far away the panel floats: in metres (0.30 - 3.00) as a VR layer, "
"the default; in px of inward shift per eye with menu_vr_layer = 0. Same size at every depth. "
"Change it if the panel is tiring to look at. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Samo VR, zato v ravnem načinu zasivljeno. Kako daleč lebdi plošča: v metrih (0,30 - 3,00) kot "
"sloj VR, privzeto; v px notranjega zamika na oko pri menu_vr_layer = 0. Enaka velikost pri vsaki "
"globini. Spremenite, če je gledanje plošče naporno. Brez cene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. On = the panel turns to face you when you move it to the side, same "
"size from every angle (as a VR layer, the default, the head-following fps box too); off = a flat "
"picture. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Samo VR, zato v ravnem načinu zasivljeno. vkl. = plošča se obrne proti vam, ko jo premaknete "
"vstran, enaka velikost pod vsakim kotom (kot sloj VR, privzeto, tudi polje fps, ki sledi glavi); "
"izk. = ravna slika. Brez cene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"A small live fps and frame-time box, also while this menu is closed (flat and VR). Use it to see "
"what a setting gains. Its GPU cost is measured: per frame, every picture it is drawn into; none "
"when off. Save keeps it for the next start."
msgstr ""
"Majhno živo polje s fps in časom sličice, tudi ko je ta meni zaprt (ravni način in VR). Uporabite "
"ga, da vidite, kaj nastavitev prinese. Njegova cena GPU je izmerjena: na sličico, vsaka slika, v "
"katero se riše; nič, ko je izklopljeno. Shrani ga obdrži do naslednjega zagona."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The fps box's lock, position, size, colour, VR distance and turn. Right opens the group, Left "
"closes it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Zaklep, položaj, velikost, barva, razdalja v VR in obrat polja fps. Desno skupino odpre, Levo jo "
"zapre; ob vsakem odprtju menija je zaprta."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only. Follow head = moves with the headset. Fixed in play space = one spot around your seat, "
"ignores the cab's sway. Attached to vehicle = stuck to the cab, sways with it (needs DLAA + "
"Per-part motion vectors). No cost."
msgstr ""
"Samo VR. Sledi glavi = premika se s slušalkami. Fiksno v igralnem prostoru = eno mesto okoli "
"sedeža, ne upošteva nihanja kabine. Pritrjeno na vozilo = prilepljeno na kabino, niha z njo "
"(zahteva DLAA + vektorje gibanja delov). Brez cene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR, Attached to vehicle only. On = each truck / car keeps its own fps box spot in the cab, turn, "
"size, colour, brightness and text (saved in dlaa.ini when the menu closes). Off = one shared set "
"for every vehicle. No cost."
msgstr ""
"VR, samo Pritrjeno na vozilo. vkl. = vsak tovornjak / avto ima lastno mesto polja fps v kabini, "
"obrat, velikost, barvo, svetlost in besedilo (shranjeno v dlaa.ini ob zaprtju menija). izk. = en "
"skupen nabor za vsa vozila. Brez cene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR, Attached to vehicle only. Right = measure the cab again now (sit still, parked) if the box "
"sits off. Left = this vehicle's box back to the defaults (spot, turn, size, colour, text); other "
"vehicles keep theirs. The box is square to the cab."
msgstr ""
"VR, samo Pritrjeno na vozilo. Desno = znova izmeri kabino zdaj (sedite pri miru, parkirani), če "
"polje ne stoji pravilno. Levo = polje tega vozila nazaj na privzeto (mesto, obrat, velikost, "
"barva, besedilo); druga vozila obdržijo svoje. Polje je pravokotno na kabino."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves the fps box sideways, in % of the screen (VR fixed / attached: degrees around you). Flat "
"and VR each keep their own position. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Premakne polje fps vstran, v % zaslona (VR fiksno / pritrjeno: stopinje okoli vas). Ravni način "
"in VR imata vsak svoj položaj. Brez cene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves the fps box up / down, in % of the screen (VR fixed / attached: degrees, minus = up). Flat "
"and VR each keep their own position. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Premakne polje fps gor / dol, v % zaslona (VR fiksno / pritrjeno: stopinje, minus = gor). Ravni "
"način in VR imata vsak svoj položaj. Brez cene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. Turns the fps box left / right on itself, in degrees (+ = its face "
"turns to the right). Use it to angle the box when it sits at the side. 0 = it faces you. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Samo VR, zato v ravnem načinu zasivljeno. Obrne polje fps levo / desno okoli lastne osi, v "
"stopinjah (+ = njegova sprednja stran se obrne v desno). Uporabite za nagib polja, ko je ob "
"strani. 0 = gleda proti vam. Brez cene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. Tilts the fps box, in degrees (+ = its top leans away from you, as if "
"lying on the dashboard). 0 = it faces you. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Samo VR, zato v ravnem načinu zasivljeno. Nagne polje fps, v stopinjah (+ = njegov vrh se nagne "
"stran od vas, kot da leži na armaturni plošči). 0 = gleda proti vam. Brez cene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. Rotates the fps box in its own plane, in degrees (+ = clockwise). 0 = "
"upright. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Samo VR, zato v ravnem načinu zasivljeno. Zavrti polje fps v njegovi ravnini, v stopinjah (+ = v "
"smeri urnega kazalca). 0 = pokonci. Brez cene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Makes the fps box bigger or smaller (0.2 .. 3.0). Raise it if you cannot read it in the headset "
"or on a big screen. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Polje fps poveča ali zmanjša (0,2 .. 3,0). Povečajte, če ga v slušalkah ali na velikem zaslonu ne "
"morete prebrati. Brez cene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The colour of the fps box's text: 20 colours, each with an outline so it reads on any picture "
"(black on white = dark text, white outline). Flat and VR. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Barva besedila polja fps: 20 barv, vsaka z obrobo, da je berljiva na vsaki sliki (črna na beli = "
"temno besedilo, bela obroba). Ravni način in VR. Brez cene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How bright the fps box is, 10 - 100 %: 100 = the colour as it is, lower dims the text (the "
"outline stays) toward black. Use it to tone the counter down at night or in the headset. Flat and "
"VR. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Svetlost polja fps, 10 - 100 %: 100 = barva nespremenjena, nižje zatemni besedilo (obroba ostane) "
"proti črni. Uporabite za zatemnitev števca ponoči ali v slušalkah. Ravni način in VR. Brez cene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How see-through the whole fps box is, 10 - 100 %: 100 = solid, lower fades the text AND its black "
"outline together, so a dimmed box does not turn into a black blob. Flat and VR. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Kako prosojno je celotno polje fps, 10 - 100 %: 100 = polno, nižje bledi besedilo IN njegova črna "
"obroba skupaj, zato se zatemnjeno polje ne spremeni v črno packo. Ravni način in VR. Brez cene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. How far away the fps box floats, 0.30 - 3.00 m. It keeps the same "
"size in your view at every distance; only the depth changes. Put it near the depth you look at to "
"read it without refocusing. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Samo VR, zato v ravnem načinu zasivljeno. Kako daleč lebdi polje fps, 0,30 - 3,00 m. Obdrži enako "
"velikost v pogledu pri vsaki razdalji; spremeni se le globina. Postavite ga blizu globine, na "
"katero gledate, da ga preberete brez ponovnega izostrenja. Brez cene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"What goes into dlaa_inject.log: off = nothing; errors = failures only (default); warnings = + "
"problems worked around; info = + start-up and changes; debug = + statistics, and debug also runs "
"the GPU timers and the CPU profiler."
msgstr ""
"Kaj gre v dlaa_inject.log: izk. = nič; napake = samo odpovedi (privzeto); opozorila = + obhojene "
"težave; info = + zagon in spremembe; debug = + statistika, debug pa zažene tudi časovnike GPU in "
"profiler CPU."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The language of this menu. auto = the game's language (default); Left / Right picks another one. "
"Linux / Proton: Chinese, Japanese and Korean need their fonts installed, see the README. A "
"lang\\<code>.po file next to the DLL wins, for your own fixes. Save keeps it. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Jezik tega menija. auto = jezik igre (privzeto); Levo / Desno izbere drugega. Linux / Proton: "
"kitajščina, japonščina in korejščina potrebujejo nameščene pisave, glej README. Datoteka "
"lang\\<code>.po ob DLL ima prednost, za vaše lastne popravke. Shrani jo obdrži. Brez cene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Every hotkey of this menu, one line per action, with its keyboard key and controller button. "
"Right opens the list; pick an action with Right, then press the new key or wheel button. Saved to "
"dlaa.ini at once."
msgstr ""
"Vse bližnjice tega menija, ena vrstica na dejanje, s tipko na tipkovnici in gumbom krmilnika. "
"Desno odpre seznam; dejanje izberite z Desno, nato pritisnite novo tipko ali gumb volana. Takoj "
"se shrani v dlaa.ini."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Writes everything shown here into dlaa.ini (settings, and the panel / fps box positions once you "
"moved them), keeping every other line. Do it once you like what you see, or the changes are gone "
"at the next start. Mode saves itself."
msgstr ""
"Zapiše vse tukaj prikazano v dlaa.ini (nastavitve ter položaja plošče / polja fps, ko ste ju "
"premaknili), vse druge vrstice ohrani. Naredite to, ko vam je rezultat všeč, sicer so spremembe "
"ob naslednjem zagonu izgubljene. Način se shrani sam."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Puts every setting in this menu back to how the mod ships (model, sharpen, texture sharpness, "
"DLAA area, motion, mirrors, profile, panel, fps box, turbo, foveated, frame rate, logging), live "
"and in dlaa.ini, keeping your hotkeys and every other line."
msgstr ""
"Vsako nastavitev tega menija vrne na tovarniško (model, ostrenje, ostrina tekstur, območje DLAA, "
"gibanje, ogledala, profil, plošča, polje fps, turbo, foveated, hitrost sličic, beleženje), v živo "
"in v dlaa.ini, vaše bližnjice in vse druge vrstice pa ohrani."

