#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Back to the main menu. %hs does the same on every line of this page. Every key and controller "
"button except the 5 menu keys still reaches the game while this menu is open, so you can keep "
"driving."
msgstr ""
"Nazaj v glavni meni. %hs naredi isto na vsaki vrstici te strani. Vsaka tipka in gumb krmilnika "
"razen 5 tipk menija še vedno doseže igro, ko je meni odprt, tako da lahko vozite naprej."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Press ONE new key or controller button for %ls: any key, also another menu key (it is taken from "
"it). Keys / buttons already held now are ignored until released. Esc or Backspace cancels, so "
"does 10 s without a press; menu keys cannot be cleared here."
msgstr ""
"Pritisnite ENO novo tipko ali gumb krmilnika za %ls: katero koli tipko, tudi drugo tipko menija "
"(ta ji bo odvzeta). Tipke / gumbi, ki so že pridržani, se ignorirajo, dokler jih ne spustite. Esc "
"ali Backspace prekliče, enako 10 s brez pritiska; tipk menija tu ni mogoče počistiti."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Press ONE new key (Shift / Ctrl / Alt with it make a combination) or controller button / D-pad "
"direction. Keys / buttons already held now (a shifter gear) are ignored until released; axes "
"never bind. %hs or Esc cancels, Backspace clears to none, 10 s without a press cancels."
msgstr ""
"Pritisnite ENO novo tipko (Shift / Ctrl / Alt z njo tvorijo kombinacijo) ali gumb krmilnika / "
"smer D-pada. Tipke / gumbi, ki so že pridržani (prestava ročice), se ignorirajo, dokler jih ne "
"spustite; osi se nikoli ne dodelijo. %hs ali Esc prekliče, Backspace počisti na brez, 10 s brez "
"pritiska prekliče."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid ""
"One of the 5 keys that drive this menu (dlaa.ini %hs). %hs, then press the new key or button: the "
"other menu keys can be taken too. These lines cannot be cleared, and each of the 5 must keep a "
"binding (a press that leaves another one empty is refused). Saved to dlaa.ini at once."
msgstr ""
"Ena od 5 tipk, ki upravljajo ta meni (dlaa.ini %hs). %hs, nato pritisnite novo tipko ali gumb: "
"lahko vzamete tudi druge tipke menija. Teh vrstic ni mogoče počistiti in vsaka od 5 mora imeti "
"dodelitev (pritisk, zaradi katerega bi druga ostala prazna, se zavrne). Takoj se shrani v "
"dlaa.ini."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%ls (dlaa.ini %hs). %hs, then press the new key or button: a key replaces the Keyboard part, a "
"controller button or D-pad direction the Controller part. A key / button used by another action "
"moves here. Saved to dlaa.ini at once."
msgstr ""
"%ls (dlaa.ini %hs). %hs, nato pritisnite novo tipko ali gumb: tipka zamenja del Tipkovnica, gumb "
"krmilnika ali smer D-pada del Krmilnik. Tipka / gumb, ki ga uporablja drugo dejanje, se preseli "
"sem. Takoj se shrani v dlaa.ini."

